the silver haters and constantly switch weapons, just go with the silver
saber.  Should still average more damage and takes a lot less thought.


>unless you get Grayswandir at some point, in
>which case, Grayswandir + a Katana isn't bad either.

  Grayswandir + katana are the best wielded combination in the game for
general damage.  Note that vs. silver haters a silver saber is still a
better secondary weapon.  That d20 silver damage is tough to beat,
average 10.5.  Even weapon skills and enchantment differences would have
to be worst case for katana to be better.  

  i.e. if the katana isn't +7, the silver saber probably does more
damage.  If they're both at +0, use the silver saber as secondary weapon
vs silver haters.  Otherwise the question is how much more damage and
how much trouble it is to switch weapons.


